        "+x^2(-\\cos x)\\ -\\ 2x(-\\sin x)\\ +\\ 2\\cos x",
        "\\begin{aligned}\\int x^2\\sin x\\,dx=\\ &-x^2\\cos x+2x\\sin x\\\\&+2\\cos x+C\\end{aligned}"
